<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal sets 20 bln esc variable rate repo.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal sets 20 bln esc variable rate repo.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal offered to inject 20 billion escudos of seven-day funds into the money market in a variable rate securities repurchase tender.</p>
<p>Bids for the repo, which takes effect on Tuesday, must be submitted by 1515 GMT.</p>
<p>As expected, the central bank left its official draining rate unchanged at 6.8 percent at the start of the new commercial bank reserve period.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
